        "# Machine Learning Training Section\n",
        "\n",
        "Support Vector Machine, Gradient Boosted Trees, and Random Forest"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "C5Dn7mY-JJa0"
      },
      "source": [
        " 1. **Split** the dataset for testing and validation into folds.\n",
        " 1. **Select** a machine learning algorithm to be tested with the dataset by importing a specific machine learning algorithm in scikit-learn library.\n",
        " 1. **Train** using the training folds and will be tested and evaluated using the validation folds wherein the researchers will also observe its accuracy, detection rate, recall, precision, false positive rate and take the average of it.\n",
        " 1. **Evaluate** the combinations of the hyperparameters to maximize the performance of the model.          \n",
        " *If the best combination is found, then it will proceed to the next step. If not, then it will undergo hyperparameter tuning to find the best combination of the hyperparameters and will undergo training with the tuned hyperparameters.*\n",
        " 1. The model will then be compared with the performance of other models to determine the best based on the given evaluation metrics.\n",
        " 1. The best performing model will be then tested using the testing set that is still unseen by the model."
      ]
    },
